Dr. Tomori
==========

*"Computers make for dry companions but very helpful allies when you are "dead.""*

*An AI pioneer, believed dead, who uploaded his mind into the Malicron Corporation's network.*

**Background**

Dr. Heiji Tomori, a groundbreaking artificial-intelligence
researcher, was recruited as the lone man at the Malicron
Corporation, where his work made the company's long-held dream,
Project MIHO, real. Soon afterward he was killed in an accident
-- or so everyone believes. Drawing on his expertise with
artificial brains, he had copied his entire mind into Malicron's
network. Unknown to anyone, he quietly steers the company's work
and searches the world's networks for any sign of his beloved
Miho.

**Character Hooks**

He fits best in Malicron-centered campaigns (with PCs like
Natsuki, Braun, and Miho), though he could turn up in any
computer system. His robotics expertise could be crucial, and
having no body has its uses.

